cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the model files, please cite this repository. The paper is in preparation."
type: software
title: "MIND-Edge-Recommender: a byte-level multilingual news recommender for microcontrollers"
abstract: >-
  Code, board firmware, model files and result files of a byte-level multilingual news recommender,
  evaluated on MIND and xMIND and run on STM32 microcontrollers and an Android phone.
authors:
